25,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It looks like we're great at finding support staff, but we're totally stuck when it comes to field crews or supervisors.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,George,,Our successful exits were quiet back-office tools. The one we wrote off had its own premises and hourly workers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,May,,"We're burning through reserves for follow-ons way too fast, and our credit line doesn't value subscriptions at all.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Rin,,Hardware and depots are a nightmare for reporting! They require outside appraisals that take weeks and cost a fortune.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Security reviews for medical or financial data are incredibly slow, and custom hardware is prone to huge delivery delays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, if premises are a risk, does that mean we should avoid anything with a warehouse?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,George,,"Precisely, Mio. The data suggests that lean, back-office software is where our actual wins come from.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, if those appraisals are so expensive, we really can't afford more physical assets right now.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Exactly, May! And I found that software companies just report their own figures, which is easier but less verifiable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, if the credit line ignores subscriptions, we need to be very careful about the cash flow of a subscription model.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, what about the delivery delays? Does that apply to all hardware?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,George,,I'm noticing a pattern here. Physical operations seem to be the common point of failure for us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, you're right. A subscription-heavy model might be a trap if we can't borrow against it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@George, so we want something that doesn't need a depot and doesn't require an outside auditor to verify?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, Rin. And we should avoid anything that triggers a three-quarter security review if we want a quick win.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm just worried we can't staff the leadership for anything operational.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,George,,It seems we are in agreement that lean software is the safest bet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,May,,Agreed. We need to protect our remaining cash.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Rin,,I'm on board. No more appraisal fees for me!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see the candidates and apply these filters.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
